{"id":"n89164-1-10","stage":3,"title":"환율 · 汇率","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89164-1-10-1","ko":"환율이 곧 오른다고 하네요.","zh":"听说汇率马上就要上涨了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"환율이","meaning":"汇率，汇价，兑换率，外汇牌价，外汇行市","explanation":"환율：汇率，汇价，兑换率，外汇牌价，外汇行市；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"환율","audio":"/audio/7dbb5ceb4870cdb843a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89164","senseId":"1","lemma":"환율","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곧","meaning":"就，马上，即将","explanation":"곧：就，马上，即将","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"2","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오른다고","meaning":"上升，上涨","explanation":"오르다：上升，上涨；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"오르다","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69518","senseId":"10","lemma":"오르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하네요.","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7dbb5ceb4870cdb8","term":"환율","zh":"汇率，汇价，兑换率，外汇牌价，外汇行市","audio":"/audio/7dbb5ceb4870cdb843a0.mp3","entryId":"89164","definition":"在经济领域中，本国货币换成别国货币时的比率。","pronunciation":["화ː뉼"]},{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"就，马上，即将","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"时间没过多久。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"8fdeb9822b3fa061","term":"오르다","zh":"上升，上涨","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3","entryId":"69518","definition":"价格、数值、温度、成绩等比以前多或高。","pronunciation":["오르다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/08c50577891956b2bc80.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89164-1-10-2","ko":"어쩐지 수입 상품들이 금방